            <strong>Application concept</strong>
          </h3>
          <p class="display-7">
            A position and speed estimation method without position transducer
            is applied for drives with Permanent Magnet Synchronous Motor
            (PMSM). By integrating methods, i.e. using a speed reference for
            zero speed startup and low speed acceleration, and back-EMF for
            mid-high speed operation, the rotor position can be estimated and
            controlled over the full speed range. In order to achieve correct
            operation from zero speed, the two techniques are combined with a
            crossover function based on the speed reference.
          </p>
